---
import CallToAction from "@/components/common/CallToAction.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <article
    class="container prose-lg mx-auto my-20 w-screen prose-headings:font-medium"
  >
    <h1>About Us</h1>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      "Empowering businesses to achieve their goals through innovative
      technology and personalized solutions."
    </p>

    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>
      We are a team of experienced developers, designers, and strategists
      passionate about crafting custom digital solutions. Our mission is to
      solve real-world problems and bring your vision to life.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Innovation:</strong> Embracing the latest technologies to deliver
        cutting-edge solutions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Integrity:</strong> Building trust through transparency and reliability.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Collaboration:</strong> Working closely with our clients to exceed
        expectations.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Excellence:</strong> Delivering top-notch quality in every project.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <p>We specialize in:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Custom Web Applications</li>
      <li>Mobile App Development</li>
      <li>UI/UX Design</li>
      <li>Software Integrations</li>
      <li>Ongoing Support & Maintenance</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Team</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        🧑‍💻 <strong>Developers:</strong> Turning ideas into functional, scalable software.
      </li>
      <li>
        🎨 <strong>Designers:</strong> Creating intuitive, user-focused experiences.
      </li>
      <li>
        🤝 <strong>Project Managers:</strong> Ensuring timely and successful project
        delivery.
      </li>
      <li>
        🧪 <strong>QA Engineers:</strong> Guaranteeing high-quality results.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Journey</h2>
    <p>
      Since [Founding Year], we’ve partnered with clients from various
      industries, helping them transform their ideas into reality. Our solutions
      have supported startups, small businesses, and enterprises alike, driving
      growth and efficiency.
    </p>

    <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tailored Solutions for Your Needs</li>
      <li>Agile and Transparent Processes</li>
      <li>Ongoing Support and Scalability</li>
      <li>Passionate Team Dedicated to Your Success</li>
    </ul>
  </article>

  <CallToAction
    title="Потрібна підтримка автоматизації?"
    buttonLabel="Запросити підтримку"
  >
    <p slot="description" class="max-w-lg text-lg">
      Давайте обговоримо, як ми можемо підтримувати ваші системи на максимальній
      продуктивності за допомогою експертного обслуговування, постійного
      моніторингу та оновлень продуктивності.
    </p>
  </CallToAction>
</Layout>
